    "summary": "Use it as the opponent's Movement phase begins, on 1 **GREY KNIGHTS INFANTRY** unit of yours.\n\nFor the rest of that phase, whenever an enemy unit ends up 6\" or less from your unit after being set up or after a **Normal move**, an **Advance move** or a **Fall Back move**, roll a D6. Add 2 if the chosen unit is wholly inside your [Hallowed Ground](vsdata:ability/grey-knights.warpbane-task-force.hallowed-ground); a result of 4+ inflicts D3 **mortal wounds** on the enemy unit.",
